{"step_index":264,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T11:12:51Z","input_tokens":14273,"cache_read_tokens":213225,"output_tokens":965,"content":"# 🛠️ UI Layout & CSS Bug Fixes Applied\n\nAll requested layout bugs and styling issues in **NexusMobility** have been resolved across [`styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css) and [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html).\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Summary of Fixes\n\n#### 1. Fixed Standby Lounge Ring Containment (Tab 2)\n- Set `.standby-hub-container`, `.standby-ring-wrap`, and `.standby-ring` to `position: relative !important; width: 250px; height: 250px; margin: 1rem auto;`.\n- Centered the center badge with `position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);`.\n- Constrained individual standby slots (`.standby-slot`) to `position: absolute !important;` strictly relative to the `250px × 250px` parent container. They now stay within their card and will **never** float over section headers or input forms.\n\n#### 2. Restored Visual Components (Tab 1, Tab 3 & Tab 4)\n- **Vehicle Chassis Blueprint (Tab 3)**:\n  - Formatted `.vehicle-chassis-diagram` with `border: 2px solid var(--slate-300); border-radius: 44px 44px 28px 28px; background: #FFFFFF; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);`.\n  - Added `.chassis-row` with `display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; width: 100%;`.\n  - Styled `.vehicle-seat` with `width: 64px; height: 70px; border-radius: 12px;` with active/driver-locked/reserved states and hover lift transitions.\n- **Sustainability Analytics (Tab 4)**:\n  - Added `.sustainability-grid` with `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem;`.\n  - Added `.eco-metric-card` and `.progress-bar-wrap` / `.progress-bar-fill` classes for clear climate metric cards and daily target progress visualization.\n- **Commuter Slider Ticks (Tab 1)**:\n  - Aligned `.slider-ticks` with `font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-mono);` and highlighted `.active-tick` in bold emerald.\n\n#### 3. Containment & Z-Index Guarding\n- Added `position: relative` and `overflow: hidden` across all `.white-card`, `.kpi-card`, and form panel wrappers to prevent any child elements or canvas overlays from breaking out into neighboring sections.\n- Verified that `#ambient-canvas` remains strictly at `z-index: 0` with `pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.85;`.\n- Raised all interactive cards to `z-index: 1`, the HUD overlay to `z-index: 5`, and modal dialogs to `z-index: 10000+`.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Verification\nOpen or refresh [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) in your browser. All tabs (Eco-Route Finder, Passenger Hub, Driver Fleet Console, and Sustainability Analytics) now render with contained layouts and consistent styling."}
